  "visualAcceptance": [
    "Author, hash and date stay visible and right-aligned at every capture viewport and text scale.",
    "Sparse rows start the subject close to their graph ink; there is no global graph/subject divider.",
    "Dense graphs clip before the metadata gap, in paint and in hit testing.",
    "The selection bar is an inset radius-sm bar spanning shared content and metadata for the same OID."
